title: Range Anxiety
text: Home is an easy drive, but not on red. The car leaves nearly flat, there is one charger in town, and the junction sends each car by what is left in its battery, not by what the driver wants.
trick: the fixed prism sorts by colour: red turns off down the charging lane and leaves green; green, brought back to the junction on the diagonal, turns down the same lane again and leaves blue; blue, on the same lap, goes straight through the junction and up the drive. One closed lap that stops itself when the car is full
motif: town map: junction prism, charging lane (conduit with a fixed doppler), driveway (diagonal conduit), town blocks; the top-right corner is a no-parking zone
expect: targets>=1
